From: PupJune2 <PupJune2@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0000
Subject: CromIKO feature icons

Use the icons drawn from the CromIKO logo (chunky rounded shapes, the
star of the logo, the visor face of the mascot), made by
tools/cromiko/gen_feature_icons.py, instead of the Material icons:

- App menu: Burn tabs and data, CromIKO DNS, Lock Incognito tabs,
  Manga mode and CromIKO player.
- New tab page: CromIKO DNS and Downloads in the shortcut row, the
  downloads of the Recent downloads widget, and Edit home screen.
- The shield of the ad blocker next to "Weekly report" on the shield
  card, and on "Ad blocker settings" in the weekly report.

The icons are in one color, which the menu and the new tab page tint
as before; the star stays apart from the rest, so it still shows. The
weekly report and accent color icons are added for later use.

License: GPL-3.0-only - https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-only.html
